          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP500 Evan's Cap

N 50° 59.045 W 114° 07.114&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After meeting up with geoCurious2 at the previous brass cap, we teamed up for this cap.  With multiple sets of eyes and locating devices, we quickly found this cap.  I suspect the cover for the container for this cap is missing though based on the plant growth around GZ, it's been gone for a long time.  TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684189337">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7573673">geoCurious2</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP500 - Evan's Cap&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We decided to geocache on the north side of the Glenmore Reservoir today and pick up 4 Brass Caps along the way.  We had the pleasure of meeting up with sapien who, like us, was trying to pick up as many Brass Caps as possible in last couple of days.  This find marks our 2000th cache!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
